# The hxcpp twin of tools/jvm-portability.hxml: the same probe, the same `src/`, the same
# flags, built for hxcpp — so a parse result that differs between the C++ build and js/jvm
# (a literal the C++ compiler rewrites, say) fails here. Run it from the repo root; point
# HXCPP_COMPILE_CACHE at a persistent directory or every build is a cold one:
#   HXCPP_COMPILE_CACHE=~/.hxcpp_cache node bin/dev.js jvm-portability --cpp
#   haxe tools/hxcpp-portability.hxml && bin/hxcpp-portability/JvmPortability
-cp src
-cp tools/src
-main dev.JvmPortability
-D analyzer-optimize
-cpp bin/hxcpp-portability
